extends demo.pug
block style
  style
    include ../static/style.css
    include ../static/about.css

block content
  .about-hero.reveal
    h1 About XYZ Saree Centre
    p Preserving India's textile heritage since 2023

  .about-intro.reveal
    p Welcome to XYZ Sarees, your trusted destination for exquisite sarees that blend tradition with modern elegance. At XYZ, we believe that a saree is more than just fabric—it's a symbol of grace, heritage, and timeless beauty. Our collection features handcrafted masterpieces, including luxurious Kanjeevaram, regal Banarasi, delicate Chanderi, and many more, catering to every occasion and style.

  section.timeline
    h2.section-title.reveal Our Journey
    .tl-item.reveal
      .tl-dot
      .tl-content
        h3 2023 — Founded
        p XYZ Sarees was established with a passion for fine craftsmanship, working closely with skilled artisans from across India.
    .tl-item.reveal
      .tl-dot
      .tl-content
        h3 2023 — First Collection
        p Launched our debut collection featuring Kanjeevaram, Banarasi, and Chanderi sarees.
    .tl-item.reveal
      .tl-dot
      .tl-content
        h3 2024 — Bridal Studio
        p Opened our exclusive Bridal Studio offering personalised consultation and styling.
    .tl-item.reveal
      .tl-dot
      .tl-content
        h3 2024 — Worldwide Shipping
        p Expanded to international shipping, bringing Indian heritage to doorsteps globally.

  section.why-us
    h2.section-title.reveal Why Choose XYZ Sarees?
    .why-grid
      .why-card.reveal
        .why-icon ✦
        h3 Authentic & Handcrafted
        p Sourced directly from master weavers across India.
      .why-card.reveal
        .why-icon ✦
        h3 Premium Quality Fabrics
        p Pure silks, soft cottons, and intricate hand-loomed weaves.
      .why-card.reveal
        .why-icon ✦
        h3 Exclusive & Custom Drapes
        p Unique designs you won't find anywhere else.
      .why-card.reveal
        .why-icon ✦
        h3 Sustainable Fashion
        p Supporting artisans and eco-friendly production.
      .why-card.reveal
        .why-icon ✦
        h3 Worldwide Shipping
        p Bringing Indian heritage to your doorstep, anywhere.
      .why-card.reveal
        .why-icon ✦
        h3 A Story in Every Weave
        p From festive celebrations to bridal elegance — sarees for every occasion.
